  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">01: Basst&#xf6;d till utvecklingsekonomisk forskning, bl.a. om utveckling  och &apos;Triple Crises&apos; (finansiell, mat, klimat) och bist&#xe5;nd             (effektivitet, nya trender och nya akt&#xf6;rer), samt industripolitik i   Afrika. 02: St&#xf6;d till projektet Research &amp; Communication on Foreign   Aid (ReCom) som fokuserar p&#xe5; bist&#xe5;ndeffektivitet och bist&#xe5;ndets nya   politiska ekonomi. Samfinansiering med DANIDA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">01: Core support to research in development economics. This includes  development under the Triple Crisis challenge, namely the integrated  financial crisis, food crisis and climate change crisis. 02: Support  to the project Research and Communication on Foreign Aid (ReCom) that focuses on aid effectivness and the ew political economy of foreign   aid. Co-funded with DANIDA.</narrative>
  </description>
